invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_signer.c
catches: mldsa_signer_test
reason: mldsa87_sign signs with rnd of 32 zero bytes, the deterministic
  variant, which a draw that wrote nothing leaves (INV-4). The hedge then
  rests on nothing. bin/mldsa_signer_test requires CH_ASSERT on zero rnd.

--- old
    CH_ASSERT(rnd_drawn(rnd));
--- new
    (void)rnd_drawn;
